# From the Tower to the Lighthouse: the first of our levels, built from the designer's concept (twice the length of
# the original's first, in its spirit: a groove track with straight pieces and hard square corners, railings only
# where a drop or a landing asks for them, no sacks). Four sectors, each its own courtyard of towers and columns,
# all of them turning toward the Lighthouse standing at the far edge of the map:
#  1. (wood) the tower's stair of corners, a ledge along a wall, a wooden ball led to a pier over a pool, the first
#     rails, a zigzag terrace, a wooden bridge, a square with a dome, a checkpoint;
#  2. (wood, stone, wood, paper, wood) a courtyard of choices, a stone road, a balcony over the clouds, rails that
#     snake, a gallery of boards with a crate, a checkpoint;
#  3. (stone) the stone ball's road, a lane with a loose stone ball held by a pusher and a pit the ball plugs, a
#     train of five stones, a terrace, rails that curve, the wood transformer, a checkpoint;
#  4. (wood) a long descent of nine corners, a jump, terraces, a bowling floor, a quay of boards and a boarded path
#     round the Lighthouse to the balloon's pier.
# Edit this file and run `scripts/own-levels.sh assets/levels/01_First_Roll`.
title From the Tower to the Lighthouse
title.ru От Башни к Маяку
title.de Vom Turm zum Leuchtturm
title.zh 从塔到灯塔
order 1
